                                "sense_id": "0e430ab5-3200-37e3-b73e-d074af4012f7",
                                "text": "For Meinong's extraordinary work on emotional presentation will provide a series of ideas and distinctions that will enable us to push a bit further the idea of what we might call literary showables."
